#20107
The Glade of the Antlered Stones~
   A glade ringed by old standing stones carved with antlers, where the
people of the wood once worshipped the forest's guardian. The carvings have
been defaced, scratched over with grey spirals. The grass in the glade is
dead, and in its centre lies a huge stag's skull, freshly cleaned.
