#20113
The Dead Stream~
   A stream runs through the wood, clear as glass and utterly lifeless. No
weed grows in it, no fish swim in it, and the stones on its bed are bleached
white. The water is so cold it aches. Grey sap drips into it from the trees
on the bank.
~
