The Owl Tree~
   A massive hollow oak stands alone in a ring of dead bracken. Its trunk is
split open like a door, and from inside come soft, low hoots, far too deep
for any owl. Pellets of fur and bone lie heaped around its roots, some of
them the size of a man's head.
