#20119
The Old Way~
   An ancient path paved with mossy stones runs west through the heart of
the wood, older than the track and older than Midgaard. The trees lean over
it. Here the silence is complete, a pressure in your ears, and the grey sap
runs in rivulets between the paving stones.
~
