The Approach to the Heartwood~
   The trees grow closer and taller, and their bark has turned from grey to
black. Their roots break up through the paving. Ahead, a wall of intertwined
trunks forms a living barrier with a single dark opening, and from it comes
a slow, deep sound, like breathing.
