#20122
The Heart of the Thorns~
   At the centre of the maze stands a tree that was once a woman, or a woman
who was once a tree; her arms are branches and her hair is grey moss, and
her face is twisted in endless pain. The dryad of the Hollow Wood has been
made the gardener of its thorns.
