#20123
The Heartwood~
   A vast chamber of living trees, their trunks fused into walls, their
branches a roof so thick no light comes through. In the centre stands the
Antlered One, guardian of the wood for a thousand years: a stag-headed giant
of root and bark. The West has rotted it hollow, and grey fire burns in the
cage of its ribs.
